{{Term/Store|Sneaky River Snail|Sneaky River Snails|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Creature]]s and [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Sneaky River Snail}}
Sneaky River Snails are found on the shores of bodies of [[Water (Terrain)|Water]] in [[West Necluda]] and the [[Lanayru Great Spring]]. They are easy to spot at night due to their glow.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They can be eaten raw to restore one [[Heart]] to [[Link]]'s [[Life Gauge]]. Roasting one by a [[Fire]] will result in [[Sneaky River Escargot]], but they can also be chilled by [[Ice]] to make [[Frozen River Snail]]s. [[Meal]]s made in a [[Cooking Pot]] using Sneaky River Snails will temporarily provide Link with [[Stealth Up]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/>

While [[Cooking]], Sneaky River Snails are an option to make the following Meals:
