==={{TotK|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract/TotK|Sneaky River Snail}}
{{Stub|TotK}}
Sneaky River Snails can be found near large bodies of fresh [[Water (Terrain)|Water]] throughout [[Hyrule]],<ref name="TotK Inventory"/> most commonly in [[Hyrule Ridge]] and [[Zora's Domain]]. They glow a bright green in [[Darkness]] and at night.<ref name="TotK Inventory"/> When [[Cooking|Cooked]] into [[Food]]s, they grant [[Link]] [[Stealth Up]], heightening his senses to make him move more silently.<ref name="TotK Inventory"/> When exposed to [[Fire]]s or [[Scorching Climate]]s, they become [[Sneaky River Escargot]]s, whereas when exposed to [[Ice]] or [[Freezing Climate]]s, they become [[Frozen River Snail]]s.

Sneaky River Snails are required to upgrade the following pieces of [[Armor]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]:
{{Material Armors|TotK|Sneaky River Snail}}

